{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Whether ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"this library","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when built by a 6.0+ toolchain, which selects "},{"code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its per-target language-mode setting. Reported rather than assumed, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference is invisible from the outside and decides whether the concurrency"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guarantees were checked or merely intended."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This reads the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"language mode"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", not the toolchain: "},{"code":"#if swift(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tests the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"former and "},{"code":"#if compiler(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the latter, and they genuinely differ in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package. On a 6.x toolchain the library and the examples are built in Swift 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode while the test target is deliberately still built in Swift 5 mode — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library and examples compile clean under full strict-concurrency checking and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"test harness does not, so scoping the mode to the targets that actually ship is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what makes the guarantee about the artifact you get rather than about a rewrite of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the test suite."}]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO22isSwiftSixLanguageModeSbvpZ","symbolKind":"property","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions","type":"topic","title":"SupportedVersions","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested against."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"type":"topic","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this library"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}]}}}